</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="41" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If the Sensor H Analog Value rises above the Fail High Limit, or falls below
the Fail Low Limit, has not come back within the limits (with deadband),
mark Sensor H as Out of Range.

#####  V3.0-04  2014-04-04:  Modified to better handle Inf/NaN to avoid Minor Faults.  #####]]>
