#####  V3.1-00  2014-06-30:  Added rung for Source/Quality enumerations.  #####]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(Cfg_HasChanObjC) MOV(1,Wrk_SrcQC) ,XIC(Cfg_HasChanObjC) MOV(Inp_PVCSrcQ,Wrk_SrcQC) ,XIC(Inp_PVCUncertain) MOV(16,Wrk_SrcQC) ,XIC(Inp_PVCBad) MOV(34,Wrk_SrcQC) ,[XIC(Wrk_InpCInfNaN) ,XIC(Wrk_PVCOutOfRange) ] MOV(32,Wrk_SrcQC) ,[XIC(Err_Raw) ,XIC(Err_EU) ] MOV(35,Wrk_SrcQC) ,XIC(Inp_Sim) MOV(10,Wrk_SrcQC) ,MOV(Wrk_SrcQC,SrcQ_IOC) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="112" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Source and Quality (Srcq) for Val_PVD
Start with the Srcq from the Input Channel object if it's available.
