#####  V3.1-00  2014-06-30:  Added rung for Source/Quality enumerations.  #####]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(Cfg_HasChanObjE) MOV(1,Wrk_SrcQE) ,XIC(Cfg_HasChanObjE) MOV(Inp_PVESrcQ,Wrk_SrcQE) ,XIC(Inp_PVEUncertain) MOV(16,Wrk_SrcQE) ,XIC(Inp_PVEBad) MOV(34,Wrk_SrcQE) ,[XIC(Wrk_InpEInfNaN) ,XIC(Wrk_PVEOutOfRange) ] MOV(32,Wrk_SrcQE) ,[XIC(Err_Raw) ,XIC(Err_EU) ] MOV(35,Wrk_SrcQE) ,XIC(Inp_Sim) MOV(10,Wrk_SrcQE) ,MOV(Wrk_SrcQE,SrcQ_IOE) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="114" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Source and Quality (Srcq) for Val_PVF
Start with the Srcq from the Input Channel object if it's available.
